> The design of the wine room was created utilizing a reclaimed door and[ wood] from a[ barn] located on the property[.] We were able to use the reclaimed door's existing hardware to provide rustic charm and appeal[.] In addition the wood was used to create the "X" pattern shel[ving] with[ accent lighting to] provide[ warm ambient] light that enhances the overall look[.]

=== Text #8 ===
> After the martyrdom of[ St.] Boniface, Vergilius was made Bishop of Sal[z]burg (766 or 767) and laboured successfully for the upbuilding of his diocese as well as for the spread of the Faith in neighbouring heathen countries, especially in Carinthia[.] He died at Sal[z]burg, 27 November, 7[89]. In 1233 he was canonized by Gregory IX. His doctrine that the earth is a sphere was derived from the teaching of ancient geographers, and his belief in the existence of the[ antip]odes was probably[ influenced] by the accounts which the ancient Irish voyagers gave of their journeys. This, at least, is the opinion of Rett[berg] ("Kirchengesch. Deutschlands", II, 236).

